⏺ Here are the main debugging approaches for terminal UIs like TOM:

  1. File Logging (Most Common)

  import { debug, debugMouse } from './src/utils/debug.js';

  // Log to tom-debug.log file
  debug('Mouse clicked at', x, y);
  debugMouse('click', { x, y, element: element.tagName });

