  The standard DOM approach is:
  - element.style.flexDirection = 'row' (camelCase accessor)
  - element.style.setProperty('flex-direction', 'row') (kebab-case property name)
  - getComputedStyle(element).flexDirection (camelCase getter)

  So in my implementation above:
  - The property names passed to setProperty() should be kebab-case
  - The JavaScript accessors should be camelCase
  - The getters/setters should convert between the two

